<A=20
      =
href=3D"http://www.sparetimegizmos.com/Software/WinEight.htm">WinEight</A=
>=20
      or the <A=20
      =
href=3D"http://www.sparetimegizmos.com/Hardware/SBC6120-2.htm">SBC6120</A=
>=20
      and you can download an <A=20
      href=3D"http://www.sparetimegizmos.com/Downloads/ADVENT.ZIP">IDE=20
      image</A>.&nbsp; This image contains these files: </P>
