"=20
      width=3D400 align=3Dright vspace=3D3 border=3D0=20
      xthumbnail-orig-image=3D"images/Adventure.gif"></A>No source files =
are=20
      available - as far as I know they have been lost. If you have the =
source=20
      for the PDP-8/OS-8 Adventure, please please please <A=20
      href=3D"mailto:webmaster@sparetimegizmos.com?subject=3DPDP-8 =
Adventure Source!">contact=20
      me</A>! </P>
      <P>To run <B>ADVENT.LD</B> and create <B>ADVENT.SV</B>, follow the =

      instructions in <B>ADVENT.DC</B>.&nbsp; There is one error in =
these=20
      instructions - where it tells you to type</P>
      <BLOCKQUOTE>
        <P><B>*ADVENT.DA/2 </B></P></BLOCKQUOTE>
      <P>to create the binary travel tables, you really need to type</P>
      <BLOCKQUOTE>
        <P><B>*ADVENT.DA&lt;/2</B> </P></BLOCKQUOTE>
      <P>A small difference, but a critical one!<BR =
clear=3Dright>&nbsp;</P>
      <P>Here are a couple of other warnings to keep in mind:=20
      </P><!--mstheme--></FONT><!--msthemelist-->
      <TABLE cellSpacing=3D0 cellPadding=3D0 width=3D"100%" =
