if"=20
            width=3D20></TD>
          <TD vAlign=3Dtop width=3D"100%"><!--mstheme--><FONT=20
            face=3D"arial, Arial, Helvetica"><B>ADVENT</B> (actually, =
the entire=20
            <B>FORTRAN-IV</B> run time system) <B><I>won't work with the =

            IOB6120!</I></B>&nbsp; If you have an IOB6120, you'll have =
to remove=20
            it before you can run Adventure. Sorry. Jim Kearney is =
already aware=20
            of this =
problem.<!--mstheme--></FONT><!--msthemelist--></TD></TR><!--msthemelist-=
